{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54362","headline":"维扬冬末寄幕中二从事 · 杜荀鹤","name":"维扬冬末寄幕中二从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道长溪尉，相留一馆闲。\n已投三寸管，尚隔几重山。\n爲旅春风外，怀人夜雨间。\n年来疏览镜，怕见减朱颜。\n（《四库全书》本《唐风集》卷一）（按：《全唐诗》卷六九一收此诗，第三句全缺，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}